n; the preview has alternative text and the copy buttons are named by what they copy."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Panel dialog, Stack, Text, Icon, Image, TextInput, Disclosure, Badge, Button, Alert); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The drop area and the chosen-file chip are drawn from Stack, Icon and Text because the Kit has no file input Widget; the slide-over is a Panel dialog, which is a card where the real one is flush and full height, and the toast after a copy is not modelled.","Every visible string of the page is bound with $i18n except the Asset's name, filename, media type, ID, revision, digest and the names of the Views; en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member opened an Asset from its tile or row on the Assets page; a holder of assets.write on a desktop layout can edit, anyone else (or while someone else holds the edit lease) reads.","The base state is the Asset Header logo (an image bound by two Views) with nothing edited: name, filename and media type, a drop area for replacing the content, the Views using it, Details, Delete and Download.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the slide-over is a column on the right of a dimmed ground."],"intent":"Show the Asset detail slide-over of the Assets page as built from Adapter Widgets only: the preview, the metadata to edit, replacing the content, the Views that bind the Asset, its identity and revision, and the problems it has.","interactionRules":["Editing the name, filename or media type, or choosing a replacement file, makes the footer show the number of unsaved changes with Discard and Save changes (Replace content once a file is chosen); the name and filename are required and the filename holds no slash.","Replacing the content keeps the Asset's identity, so every binding stays valid, and the content and the metadata are written together in one change; the file chosen fills in the filename and media type.","A save refused by a newer revision keeps the draft and offers Reload theirs and Compare; a lease held by someone else shows who and until when and keeps the draft; another refusal shows its reasons.","Used by lists the Views that bind the Asset, and an Asset no View binds says so and stays until someone deletes it; an Asset with problems lists each one with its code and path and shows no preview.","Details shows the Asset's ID, revision and content digest, each with a copy action; Download gives the content; Delete asks first."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"d8e4c201-3c4d-4e5f-8a61-7c8d9eafb003"}],"requirements":["01a115cd-bf91-7d0e-900c-73b4ba2e5095","01a115cd-bfcb-7615-aa0a-4f46ae0808c6"]},"variants":{"conflict":{"requirements":["01a11485-f451-72eb-81ad-686aeec7b3eb"],"state":{"conflict":{"visible":true},"footer-actions":{"visible":false},"name":{"value":"Header logo (light)"},"save-bar":{"visible":true},"save-bar-save":{"disabled":true}}},"details-open":{"state":{"details":{"open":true}}},"edited":{"requirements":["01a115cd-bfcb-7615-aa0a-4f46ae0808c6"],"state":{"footer-actions":{"visible":false},"name":{"value":"Header logo (light)"},"save-bar":{"visible":true}}},"filename-invalid":{"state":{"filename":{"invalid":true,"value":"logos/brand-mark.svg"},"filename-error":{"visible":true},"footer-actions":{"visible":false},"save-bar":{"visible":true},"save-bar-save":{"disabled":true}}},"locked":{"requirements":["01a11485-f118-764c-ab2b-1b54b4270625"],"state":{"delete":{"visible":false},"lock-badge":{"visible":true},"meta-edit":{"visible":false},"meta-readonly":{"visible":true},"meta-readonly-tier":{"visible":false}}},"locked-save":{"requir